# Herdr Phalanx skill - gitignore
#
# Rule (P6 / WikiSkill Raw Layer): raw.jsonl is append-only fact stream,
# contains per-machine specifics (pane IDs, session IDs, transient state).
# It ages fast and should NOT be versioned.
